# The Kiki-Jiki and Pestermite combination, three times round. Kiki-Jiki copies Pestermite; the token enters with haste (CR
# 707.9b) and its own copy of Pestermite's enters trigger (CR 603.6a), which targets Kiki-Jiki and untaps it (CR 701.26b), so
# Kiki-Jiki can copy again. Each activation is Bot1's own choice, so the loop is as long as Bot1 makes it (CR 732.1b: no
# forced loop). Bot1 stops after three tokens and attacks with them and Kiki-Jiki - all with haste - while the original
# Pestermite, cast this turn, can't: 2 + 2 + 2 + 2 = 8 damage. At the end step each token's delayed ability sacrifices it
# (CR 603.7c): three of them, and none is left waiting.

[Bot1 Deck]
Island
Mox Sapphire
Mox Ruby
Mox Jet
Island
Pestermite
Black Lotus
Kiki-Jiki, Mirror Breaker
Island x8

[Bot2 Deck]
Plains x15

